### Page 5 of 5

```text
Announcement was made that due to the Memorial Day Holiday on Monday, May 27, 2013, the
regularly scheduled meeting of the Governing Body will instead be held on Tuesday, May 28, 2013
beginning at 6:00 p.m. in City Council Chambers, Municipal Building, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne,
Wyoming.
There being no further business to come before the governing body, the meeting was officially
adjourned at 6:11 p.m.
Submitted by,
Carol Intlekofer, MMC
City Clerk
This notice is available in alternative, accessible formats upon request.
Published:
Wyoming Tribune-Eagle
May 20, 2013
